      ],
      "source": "https://www.stgeorgealaska.com/village"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The designation of St. George as a National Landmark stems from its rich history in the commercial fur seal industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.stgeorgealaska.com/village"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Interpretive tours of the fur seal harvest plant on St. George let you learn about the industry’s manufacturing process.",
